<title>SPAIN: Spain harmonised June CPI yr/yr 1.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain harmonised June CPI yr/yr 1.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics</p>
<p>Institute (INE) gave the following figures:</p>
<p>						JUNE 97    MAY 97   APRIL 97</p>
<p>    Harmonised CPI year-on-year	 1.4	  1.3	 1.6</p>
<p>    CPI, domestic calculation	   1.6	  1.5	 1.7</p>
<p>Maximum level that still</p>
<p>    meets Maastricht's criteria	 2.5	  2.5	 2.4</p>
<p> INDEX BY COMPONENTS		   JUNE 97/JUNE 96</p>
<p> Food					   -1.7</p>
<p> Alcohol and tobacco			10.7</p>
<p> Clothing, shoes			     1.9</p>
<p> Housing					 3.3</p>
<p> Household goods			     1.6</p>
<p> Medicine					0.2</p>
<p> Transport				     2.3</p>
<p> Communications				0.0</p>
<p> Leisure and culture			 1.4</p>
<p> Education				     3.9</p>
<p> Hotels, cafes and restaurants	   3.0</p>
<p> Other					   2.1</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
